        <rdfs:label>Department</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A government department acting as a regulatory authority under Australian legislation.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A government department with regulatory authority.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The Australian Government department responsible for administering the VET Student Loans program.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The Australian government department responsible for auditing approved course providers.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The government department referenced as the authority in the provision.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The government department referenced as the authority in the regulatory provision.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The government department responsible for administering the VET Student Loans program.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The government department responsible for administering the VET Student Loans scheme.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


