        <skos:definition>A resource representing a monetary amount or financial instrument.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A resource representing monetary amounts or financial instruments.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A resource representing monetary amounts, such as loans or fees.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A resource representing monetary value, such as fees, loans, or funds.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A resource that represents monetary value or financial instruments.</skos:definition>
