        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance record.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance that can be recredited under certain conditions.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance that can be recredited under special circumstances.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance under Australian legislation.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance, representing the amount of VET Student Loan used to pay tuition fees.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance, representing the amount of loan available or used.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program balance.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The accumulated loan balance under the Higher Education Loan Program (HELP) in Australia.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The balance of a student&apos;s Higher Education Loan Program account.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The remaining amount a student can borrow under the Higher Education Loan Program, calculated as the HELP loan limit minus used amounts.</skos:definition>
