        <skos:definition>The action of reducing a student&apos;s HELP balance by the tuition fee amount when a VET Student Loan is accessed.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


    <!-- https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/au#HELPLoanLimit -->


