        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition in a course</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition in a course or part of a course.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition in an approved course.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition services, as defined under Australian education regulations.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition, including RPL assessment fees that fall within the definition of tuition fees.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>A fee charged for tuition, which may be adjusted based on the portion of a course a student is required to complete.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Fees charged for tuition, covering essential course services</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The total fees to be charged to a student for a course, including covered fees and any gap fee.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>Tuition fees charged to students for educational services.</skos:definition>
    </owl:Class>
    


