        <skos:closeMatch rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cco-gro/onto/us#ParentsContribution"/>
        <skos:definition>A calculated amount representing a spouse&apos;s expected contribution, determined as 10% of the total family income above the CSFA Program income threshold, pro-rated weekly and applied for each week of the student&apos;s study period, capped at 34 2/3 weeks if enrolled in more than 34 2/3 weeks.</skos:definition>
