        <cco:hasConditionExpression>Students who began their part-time studies prior to 2015/16 continue to be eligible for funding through the province in which their institution is located based on the residency policy at the time they initially applied. Residency for part-time students is determined based on the independent student criteria.</cco:hasConditionExpression>
