        <cco:hasConditionExpression>A letter from the parent(s) confirming the irreconcilable breakdown in family relations and their refusal to support the student may be submitted. If the family rift is so serious that a parental letter cannot be obtained, a letter from a professional third party having first-hand knowledge of the situation may be substituted. If the student was a youth under the guardianship or in an agreement with a provincial or territorial child welfare agency on their 19th birthday, relevant documentation confirming their status is required.</cco:hasConditionExpression>
        <rdfs:label>Eligibility Criteria</rdfs:label>
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#CAN_UNIT_00381"/>
    </owl:Thing>
    


