        <cco:hasActionExpression>The parents&apos; contribution from assets is calculated by multiplying discretionary net worth by the conversion rate of 12%, and if negative, it is set to zero. The parents&apos; available income and contribution from assets are added together to determine the parents&apos; adjusted available income. The total parents&apos; contribution from adjusted available income is calculated from the amounts and rates in Table A5, where rates increase from 22% to 47% as adjusted available income increases.</cco:hasActionExpression>
        <rdfs:label>Calculate Parents&apos; Contribution</rdfs:label>
        <prov:wasDerivedFrom rdf:resource="https://w3id.org/cco-gro/data#USA_UNIT_00184"/>
