        <rdfs:label>Student Contribution Calculation Rule</rdfs:label>
        <skos:definition>A structural calculation rule: the student&apos;s available income is multiplied by the assessment rate of 50% to determine the student&apos;s contribution from income, which may be a negative number as low as -1,500. If the value is positive, set this allowance to 0.</skos:definition>
