        <skos:definition>The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program who may be eligible for financial assistance.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program, eligible for student financial assistance.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program, eligible to request funding and loan rehabilitation application reviews.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The role of an individual enrolled in an educational program.</skos:definition>
        <skos:definition>The role of an individual enrolled in part-time or full-time studies at a designated educational institution.</skos:definition>
